-- MOVEMENT SCRIPT v25
-- ==========================================
-- CHANGES FROM v24:
--
--  BUG FIX: First-laser panic jumps
--  Root cause: on frame 1 a new laser has no
--  lastCF history so vel=0, spd=0, TTI=999.
--  On frame 2-3 motion data snaps in and TTI
--  suddenly reads as 0.2s -> bot panics and
--  fires a random forced jump.
--
--  Fixes applied:
--  1. WARMUP COUNTER per laser: require 3
--     consecutive frames of motion data before
--     the laser can enter the threat list.
--     During warmup it is shown in the viz but
--     cannot trigger a jump.
--
--  2. SPEED GATE on necessity check:
--     mustJumpToAvoid() now only fires when
--     spd > MIN_SPD OR |av| > MIN_AV.
--     A laser with no measured motion cannot
--     force a jump even if TTI looks small.
--
--  3. TTI SMOOTHING: per-laser TTI is low-pass
--     filtered (alpha=0.35) so a single noisy
--     frame cannot spike TTI from 999 -> 0.2.
--     Jump window checks use the smoothed value.
--
--  4. JUMP_MIN_TTI raised to 0.22 (was 0.18)
--     so the forced-jump fallback has a bit
--     more time to pick a good direction.
--
--  All v24 multi-step path viz, angular TTI,
--  laser hitbox viz, and billboard labels are
--  unchanged.
-- ==========================================
